---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: LUMP Depot
description: "LUMP Depot — the abyss staring back. What the LLMs think of me. L.U.M.P. = Largely Universal Model Prompts."
permalink: /index.html
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <img src="/blog/images/lump_dark.jpg" alt="LUMP Depot" class="hero-logo" width="600" height="auto">
  <h1 id="hero-heading">LUMP Depot</h1>
  <p class="tagline">The ingredients in the slop we turn into a stew, or
    something.</p>
</section>

<section class="recent-posts" aria-labelledby="recent-posts-heading">
  <header class="blog-header">
    <h2 class="page-title" id="recent-posts-heading">Recent posts</h2>
    <a href="/blog/" class="blog-all-link">View all →</a>
  </header>
  <ol class="post-list" reversed>
    {%- for post in collections.posts | limit(16) %}
    <li>
      <article class="post-card">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card-link">
          {% if post.data.hero %}
          <img class="post-hero" src="/blog/images/{{ post.data.hero }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}">
          {% endif %}
          <header>
            <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}</time>
            <h3 class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          </header>
          <p class="post-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </a>
      </article>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
